  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the notification for the post of <strong>Specialist Officer SO (Wealth Executive, Credit Analyst)</strong>. This recruitment has been issued for 1100 posts. Online applying process for Bank of Baroda Executive, Credit Analyst Recruitment 2026 has started on 04 September 2026 &amp; the candidates can apply till 24 September 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for Bank of Baroda Executive, Credit Analyst Recruitment 2026 which has given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bank of Baroda (BOB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bank of Baroda Executive, Credit Analyst Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt. No. : BOB/HRM/REC/ADVT/2026/17</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Apply Start Date :&nbsp;<strong>04 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Online Apply Last Date :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>24 September 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>24 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date<strong> : Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result Date :&nbsp;<strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>₹ 850/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PWD, ESM/DESM : <strong>₹ 175/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Women : <strong>₹ 175/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bank of Baroda SO Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On </span></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>01 September 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Credit Analyst :&nbsp;<strong>21-33 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Wealth Executive :&nbsp;<strong>22-32 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Bank of Baroda SO Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td c