ong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 37.4266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Wealth Executive</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 62.5734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Graduation in any Discipline and Valid Certification (IC 38 / NISM) with 02 Years Experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 37.4266%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Credit Analyst – C&amp;IC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 62.5734%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Graduation in any Discipline and Chartered Accountant with 01 Year Banking Experience.<br>\n</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bank of Baroda SO Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link <span style=\"color: #000000;\">bankofbaroda.in</span> or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the Bank of Baroda before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other &nbsp;Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for Bank of Baroda SO recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n